   "stem": {
      "text": "The function f is defined by f(x) = sqrt(x + 8) / (x + 4) for x < 1 and f(x) = 3 sqrt(17 - x) / (25 - 5x) for x >= 1. Consider the largest interval that contains x = 0 and on which f is continuous. What is the sum of the integers in that interval?"
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "numeric",
